 Research + Regulatory Compliance","Legal/Program Associate","NGO Legal Advisor","Senior Legal Advisor","Legal & Policy Manager","Advocacy/Policy Director"]},{"type":"p","text":"For the Environmental Law → NGO Legal Advisor pathway, the strongest candidate combines legal expertise with environmental science, public policy, community engagement and advocacy skills. The LLB provides the legal foundation, while environmental research, regulatory compliance, litigation support, climate policy, GIS awareness and strong policy writing make the graduate substantially more effective in the nonprofit and public-interest sector."}]}]}